  "scope": "Share orbit-cell membership and derive the orbit return by divisibility",
  "validation": "Paired ArithmeticWholeField and direct ArithmeticOccupation builds pass using rebuilt current-source ArithmeticCellDecoding, current-source ArithmeticCellLabels and ArithmeticCellTransfer, and current-source ArithmeticWangPlane. Target reports show 74 common declarations with unchanged types and axioms and one new private theorem; 71 client declaration reports and sampled registrations match, although client objects differ. Client probes pin eight affected and provider objects.",
  "limitations": [
    "The compiled objects and overlays are excluded. Cached transitive dependencies were not fully rebuilt. Current-source receipts and matching direct producer input objects are recorded for Decoding, CellLabels, CellTransfer and WangPlane; source snapshots of other provider files are path samples, not all authenticated producer/source associations.",
    "Target and client census reports compare printed names, types, axioms and sampled registrations; they do not assert proof-body equality. Paired timings are single samples under shared load."
  ],
